{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook traditional British and Irish dishes, build the deck, and feed mythical monsters in a card game where cooking replaces combat and every meal can mean the difference between triumph and becoming the next course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/895cf89b703a86315714587125098d67.poster.avif?t=1773087176\" aria-label=\"Princess feeding Grendel with Cranachan\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/895cf89b703a86315714587125098d67.webm?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/895cf89b703a86315714587125098d67.mp4?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR CULINARY DECK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and customise your deck with authentic recipes and spices from across the British Isles. Combine ingredients, chain flavour combos, and serve dishes that match each Horror\u2019s cravings. Feed them full before they reach you, using your growing culinary arsenal to stay one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/31e4d4c574df93665cd5493759b0ba62.poster.avif?t=1773087176\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/31e4d4c574df93665cd5493759b0ba62.webm?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/31e4d4c574df93665cd5493759b0ba62.mp4?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE MYTHICAL MONSTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter Black Annis, Jenny Greenteeth, Grendel, and other Horrors drawn from Celtic, English, Irish, Scottish, and Welsh legend. Each one brings its own appetite and personality, challenging you to satisfy their hunger before they devour you whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/60358daf559b571c9a98ae338e3d8722.poster.avif?t=1773087176\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/60358daf559b571c9a98ae338e3d8722.webm?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/60358daf559b571c9a98ae338e3d8722.mp4?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER FLAVOURS AND TASTES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dish carries a distinct taste such as sweet, salty, sour, bitter, savoury, or bland. Combining these flavours in the right order creates powerful combos that can shift the balance of any encounter. Every Horror has unique preferences, from dishes they adore like Bakewell Tart to those they despise like Fish and Chips. Discover their favourites, avoid their dislikes, and serve the perfect meal to satisfy even the most monstrous appetite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/720b40ef4b0c68abd656da2ef932f1e8.poster.avif?t=1773087176\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/720b40ef4b0c68abd656da2ef932f1e8.webm?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/720b40ef4b0c68abd656da2ef932f1e8.mp4?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE LEGENDS AND SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through enchanted woods, peaceful meadows, and spooky bogs across the British Isles. Discover legendary artefacts, epic cookware, and rare spices as you uncover characters and stories rooted in ancient folklore and mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/1e6dfd31b02eef7ee804178aee3413ae.poster.avif?t=1773087176\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/1e6dfd31b02eef7ee804178aee3413ae.webm?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/1e6dfd31b02eef7ee804178aee3413ae.mp4?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE AND GROW STRONGER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to your base after each run to refine your recipes, season your dishes, and unlock new abilities. Each attempt brings you closer to mastering the art of feeding Horrors and reaching the heart of the kingdom\u2019s hunger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/8669b11f0805f7d5c6807c143edeab93.poster.avif?t=1773087176\" aria-label=\"Princess is choosing cookware\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/8669b11f0805f7d5c6807c143edeab93.webm?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/8669b11f0805f7d5c6807c143edeab93.mp4?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry Horrors blends strategy, British and Irish folklore, and dark humour into a pixel art card game where food and fear collide.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Piece of Cake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048840/4d017dde4fe3c61f543dd45e2a18c0ef4059d629.jpg"},{"name":"Salt of the Earth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048840/ac4c01b52e1ee6de7d50a520efbd76dbb91e8441.jpg"},{"name":"Out of the Woods","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048840/9ea32037afb9dba21efddb1be49b2d866508d4ac.jpg"},{"name":"A Pinch of Salt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048840/63b7e166d2fa217e5599a1588da339a92fea189e.jpg"},{"name":"A Matter of Taste","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048840/d2b8661328489455ba565b9eb75f059f875ed08c.jpg"},{"name":"Look what the cat dragged in","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048840/4b52ff92e1f9436c515633d8d850ce37d6bcc856.jpg"},{"name":"Bog Standard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048840/39ac713e491eea1860bffbf24601f9cfd57906e3.jpg"},{"name":"Grass is Always Greener","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048840/ee9c389ce0e40ca0054322884e8b3201065dff83.jpg"},{"name":"The Talk of The Town","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048840/8e6d6cab2fa2c06debc45a09441ee9e06e76a195.jpg"},{"name":"Hats Off","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048840/f1687e4e95e5c305445aec4a50efd48a481d0321.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3048840?t=1773087176","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/e91522ce2dc98cc8ce251a60b2950d94952430a3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773087176","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/a1b0db25d9b46fe169459cc94a696fc26e1c3842/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1773087176","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/a1b0db25d9b46fe169459cc94a696fc26e1c3842/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1773087176","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3530560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook traditional British and Irish dishes, build the deck, and feed mythical monsters in a card game where cooking replaces combat and every meal can mean the difference between triumph and becoming the next course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/895cf89b703a86315714587125098d67.poster.avif?t=1773087176\" aria-label=\"Pri