play muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/60358daf559b571c9a98ae338e3d8722.poster.avif?t=1773087176\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/60358daf559b571c9a98ae338e3d8722.webm?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/60358daf559b571c9a98ae338e3d8722.mp4?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER FLAVOURS AND TASTES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dish carries a distinct taste such as sweet, salty, sour, bitter, savoury, or bland. Combining these flavours in the right order creates powerful combos that can shift the balance of any encounter. Every Horror has unique preferences, from dishes they adore like Bakewell Tart to those they despise like Fish and Chips. Discover their favourites, avoid their dislikes, and serve the perfect meal to satisfy even the most monstrous appetite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/720b40ef4b0c68abd656da2ef932f1e8.poster.avif?t=1773087176\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/720b40ef4b0c68abd656da2ef932f1e8.webm?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/720b40ef4b0c68abd656da2ef932f1e8.mp4?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE LEGENDS AND SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through enchanted woods, peaceful meadows, and spooky bogs across the British Isles. Discover legendary artefacts, epic cookware, and rare spices as you uncover characters and stories rooted in ancient folklore and mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/1e6dfd31b02eef7ee804178aee3413ae.poster.avif?t=1773087176\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/1e6dfd31b02eef7ee804178aee3413ae.webm?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/1e6dfd31b02eef7ee804178aee3413ae.mp4?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE AND GROW STRONGER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to your base after each run to refine your recipes, season your dishes, and unlock new abilities. Each attempt brings you closer to mastering the art of feeding Horrors and reaching the heart of the kingdom\u2019s hunger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/8669b11f0805f7d5c6807c143edeab93.poster.avif?t=1773087176\" aria-label=\"Princess is choosing cookware\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/8669b11f0805f7d5c6807c143edeab93.webm?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/extras/8669b11f0805f7d5c6807c143edeab93.mp4?t=1773087176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry Horrors blends strategy, British and Irish folklore, and dark humour into a pixel art card game where food and fear collide.</p>","developers":["Clumsy Bear Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048840/4d258fdc2646d061c2e2dfab1ebc40088d117c37/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1773087176","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Hungry Horrors\u00ae is a registered trademark of Clumsy Bear Studio Limited. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Ubuntu 20.04, Ubuntu 18.04, and CentOS 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64 architecture with SSE2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Integrated graphics should be enough<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 (Big Sur) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBD MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> TBD MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3048840/1983665555/e7e0937afca4612c237c157d61d32fe8fff400ce/1766179556/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766180571","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3048840/1983665555/e7e0937afca4612c237c157d61d32fe8fff400ce/1766179556/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766180571","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3048840/